      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 113,
      "zh": "纯 WebAudio 随机旋律生成器与步进音序器。选择调性、风格与复杂度，由种子生成可复现的 2 或 4 小节循环；可逐格编辑旋律、贝斯与鼓组，并将作品混录为 WAV 下载。",
      "en": "A pure WebAudio random melody generator and step sequencer. Pick a key, style and complexity, and a seed produces a reproducible 2- or 4-bar loop; edit melody, bass and drums cell by cell and mix the piece down to a WAV download."
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
